      "t": "J'ai pris ma décision.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I've made my decision.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "Tu as raison. Tout le monde le fait.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're right. Everybody does it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Je t'appelle après. D'accord?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll call you afterwards. Okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "gabriel",
      "t": "D'accord. À tout à l'heure.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay. See you later.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "cecile",
      "t": "Bonjour. J'ai rendez-vous avec le docteur Lubek.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello. I have an appointment with Doctor Lubek.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
